  "notes": "Real white rendered apartment block (3 floors) seen over a chain-link fence and trees, with a sandy kindergarten yard in front (colourful playhouse, colourful picket play-fences). White walls, flat roof. Small ORANGE terracotta tiled awnings/pent roofs over the upper windows and a GREEN-and-white striped fabric awning over the ground-floor recessed veranda (awning types not expressible -> recessed opening). Balconies with white solid parapets, potted plants, AC units, a washing line. Colours sampled from ref 2026-07-04. Environment (2026-07-05): orange + yellow-green oak trees, two dark cypresses, big spiky green bush, low hedge and a terracotta planter, street lamp; white + charcoal sedans at the kerb (shared street with 069)."
